    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Design philosophy</p>
    <h2>Start with the function, then add only what earns its place</h2>
    <p>We designed the current formula around three practical questions: what helps create a useful electrolyte profile, what supports the intestinal transport logic behind oral hydration science, and what makes the drink pleasant enough to use consistently.</p>
    <p>That leads to a compact formula rather than a long list of vitamins, stimulants, herbs or specialty compounds. It also means the product can be explained ingredient by ingredient without hiding behind a proprietary blend.</p>
    <a class="bhd-page__text-link" href="/pages/ingredient-rationale">Read the ingredient rationale <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
