    <h2>Natural Product Number 80118664</h2>
    <p>The current Best Hydrate product page identifies Health Canada Natural Product Number <strong>80118664</strong>. Health Canada explains that an eight-digit NPN identifies a natural health product authorized for sale in Canada under its labelled conditions of use.</p>
